Rāma promises to dispel sages fear and asks cause --- Bhārgava names Lavaṇa son of Madhu as terror --- Śiva grants virtuous Madhu burning spear with conditions --- Śiva limits spear to one son making wielder invulnerable --- Madhu weds Kumbhīnasī and fathers wicked Lavaṇa --- Madhu retires to Varuṇa world leaving spear to Lavaṇa --- Lavaṇa torments three worlds especially ascetics --- Sages claim Rāma sole refuge after Rāvaṇa death